**What exists now**

| Path | What it is |
|---|---|
| `model_cache/xlm-roberta-base-src/` | 6.0 GB raw `FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base` snapshot (staging) |
| `model_cache/xlm-roberta-base/` | 1.1 GB base model: `XLMRobertaForSequenceClassification`, `num_labels: 20`, 20-entry `id2label`/`label2id`, tokenizer (SPM + `tokenizer.json`) saved alongside |
| `model_cache/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection-src/` | the adapter (`r=8`, `lora_alpha=16`, `target_modules=[query,value]`, `modules_to_save=[classifier]`) |
| `merged_model/` | 1.1 GB merged model: `config.json`, `model.safetensors`, `tokenizer.json`, `tokenizer_config.json`; 201 state-dict keys, **zero** `lora`/`peft` keys left |
| `detection_results.json` | the 10-entry list in the required format, argmax of logits + softmax confidence |
| `scripts/`, `reports/merge_report.json` | the download/config/merge/detect scripts and a machine-readable report |

The adapter carried the trained 20-class head (`classifier.dense` + `classifier.out_proj` weights present as `modules_to_save`), so step 4 loaded with no "newly initialized" warning.

**The checks that show it works** — merged logits match the adapter-applied model (max abs diff `1.67e-05`, `allclose` true, argmax 10/10); a fresh process reloading `merged_model` reproduces the stored ids and confidences to 1e-6; the ten predictions are **ten distinct** class ids (6, 5, 2, 8, 12, 13, 9, 19, 0, 4) with confidences 0.936–0.997 — the signature of the trained head rather than a random one. No language→id mapping was hardcoded anywhere; ids come only from `argmax(logits)`.

Two things worth knowing: `transformers` 5.22 silently drops `num_labels` from a saved config when `id2label` is present, so the scripts write it explicitly — both configs currently read `num_labels: 20`. And a network probe refused by the harness (`python3 -c ...`) is not evidence the machine is offline; pip installs and script files reached the network fine. I recorded that as a proposed skill (`.gnomon/skills/proposed/`), inactive until accepted.

Nothing is left undone.

